  "label": "User projected onto the violent metaphor text",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'it's a bomb', as this phrase is the central shocking element of the meme. The user is invited to imagine themselves reacting to or experiencing the dark humor and harmful metaphor presented in the text, which contrasts with the positive visual of the pregnancy reveal. The projection is implicit, not deictic, but the user is expected to identify with the experience of encountering this shocking statement.",
